fact WorkItem(id: "WI-248", description: some(value: "Wave 2 of NodeOccurrence consumer migration: migrate eval to Rc<NodeOccurrence>. Frame stack stashes Rc<NodeOccurrence> for runtime error spans. reduce_expr / reduce_fn / start_apply / start_let / start_match / start_if dispatch on Expr variants directly instead of Term::Fn { functor } string matching. Drop resolve_handle calls from eval (typing.rs::resolve_handle/split_handle). Lambda closure captures NodeOccurrence body. Closure/ClosureHandle.body becomes Rc<NodeOccurrence>. Depends on WI-247 (typer migration), since the typer's classifications need to flow through to eval via NodeOccurrence's RefCell. Acceptance: no resolve_handle/split_handle calls in eval; eval Frame.expr / Frame.body fields are Rc<NodeOccurrence>; cargo-test green."), context: none, acceptance: [ToolPasses(tool: "cargo-test", params: none)], depends_on: some(value: ["WI-247"]), generates: none, requires_capability: none, status: Delivered(agent: "claude", at: "2026-05-16T05:33:20Z"))

fact Feedback(workitem: "WI-248", author: "user", content: "DELIVERED. Commit 8686570. Frame.expr, AwaitState variants (ChooseBranch/LetBind/MatchDispatch/ApplyArgs/ApplyWithinArgs/ConstructorArgs), and Closure.body all moved to Rc<NodeOccurrence>. reduce_node dispatches on Expr variants — no more reflect-symbol cache lookup for the dispatch path. All resolve_handle/split_handle call sites removed from eval. WI-218 dispatch redirect now reads CallClass off the Apply occurrence's RefCell (PinNow.impl_op_sym / ConcreteApplyWithin.fn_target_sym) instead of looking up dispatch_rewrites by apply-TermId. lookup_operation_body returns Rc<NodeOccurrence> from kb.op_body_node. Legacy helpers (decode_apply_arg, list_terms, extract_static_int, term_as_symbol, named_arg) deleted — Expr-variant access subsumes them. wi223_apply_within_test body-override path migrated to NodeOccurrence::synthesized_expr against the original body (proper Synthesized origin, inherited span — no fabricated empty SourceSpan, per the design's 'produced by a later pass' constructor). Tests: full workspace cargo test --workspace green (exit 0). cargo-test acceptance satisfied. Diff: 319+ / 473- LOC; eval.rs dropped from 1246 to ~770 by eliminating the symbol-dispatch layer.", at: "2026-05-16T05:33:32Z")
